n  one session that is as if the Dow  dropped 5,000 points or more right now  that was caused by a confluence of  various things but reality is those  things are not cret present now they  could always happen it's good to be  defensive don't take on too much risk  and yet we recovered from that and will  from the next correct well yes but we  don't want have to go through it again  Phil thank you thank you very much
 

